      "text": "Quantum Field Theory and the Volume Conjecture — 15 sections: Front matter; Preliminaries; The many dimensions of the volume\n\n**Quantum Field Theory and the Volume Conjecture**\n\n*Tudor Dimofte and Sergei Gukov*\n\n32 pp, 15 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Preliminaries; 2 The many dimensions of the volume conjecture; 2.1 Parametrized VC; 2.2 Quantum VC; 2.3 Groups and representations; 2.4 Links and 3-manifolds; 3 TQFT; 3.1 Cutting and gluing; 3.2 Quantization; 3.2.1 Methods; 3.2.2 Simple examples; 3.3 Chern-Simons theory; 3.3.1 Quantization of Chern-Simons theory; 3.3.2 Synthesis",
